    "numericMeaning": "沿用冻结Python有限二进制浮点原值，直接比较，不加epsilon、不按显示值舍入、不clip。medianAbsoluteReturn20为过去20间隔收益中位数；matchedBreadthChange5为固定T/T-5交集的20日正收益广度变化（百分点），不是5日投资回报。",
    "unknownPriority": "必要字段缺失、非有限、类型/范围错误，或matched5.available不为true，市场判据记unknown且不新开仓；即使另一个已知条件为false也保留unknown及全部可知谓词。必要证据齐全时，全部通过为true，任一未过为false；仅true允许新信号。",
    "firstFiveTargetSessions": "缺少已冻结T-5目标期行，统一unknown，不从2021暖启动追认比较端点。",
    "noOtherGate": "不增加成交额、昨日强势延续率、角色、主题、持仓数量、收益标签或新市场分类门槛。",
    "fieldDomains": {
      "price20.coverage": "finite int/float excluding bool, within [0,1]",
      "matched5.available": "strict bool; false is known absence of the required comparison, hence overall unknown",
      "matched5.pairedCoverageFixed": "finite int/float excluding bool, within [0,1]",
      "price20.medianAbsoluteReturn20": "finite int/float excluding bool, >=-1 with no upper bound; signed return, not absolute value; finite floating ratios may round to -1",
